              <caption name="03 — 包含竹內涼真飾演的淳一" lane="1" offset="3.96s" start="0s" duration="2.28s" role="captions.zh-Hant?captionFormat=ITT.zh-Hant"><text placement="bottom" alignment="center">包含竹內涼真
