              <caption name="04 — 以及井上真央飾演的萬季子" lane="1" offset="6.24s" start="0s" duration="2.64s" role="captions.zh-Hant?captionFormat=ITT.zh-Hant"><text placement="bottom" alignment="center">以及井上真央
