              <caption name="05 — 他們在學校埋下了那把手槍" lane="1" offset="8.88s" start="0s" duration="3.10s" role="captions.zh-Hant?captionFormat=ITT.zh-Hant"><text placement="bottom" alignment="center">他們在學校
