              <caption name="06 — 槍擊案就此展開" lane="1" offset="11.98s" start="0s" duration="1.28s" role="captions.zh-Hant?captionFormat=ITT.zh-Hant"><text placement="bottom" alignment="center">槍擊案就此展開</text></caption>
              <caption name="07 — 隨後各奔東西" lane="1" offset="13.26s" start="0s" duration="3.66s" role="captions.zh-Hant?captionFormat=ITT.zh-Hant"><text placement="bottom" alignment="center">隨後各奔東西，試圖假裝
一切都沒有發生</text></caption>
              <caption name="08 — 但二十三年後淳一成為了刑警" lane="1" offset="16.92s" start="0s" duration="3.22s" role="captions.zh-Hant?captionFormat=ITT.zh-Hant"><text placement="bottom" alignment="center">但二十三年後
淳一成為了刑警</text></caption>
              <caption name="09 — 他在現場發現了那把手槍" lane="1" offset="20.14s" start="0s" duration="2.72s" role="captions.zh-Hant?captionFormat=ITT.zh-Hant"><text placement="bottom" alignment="center">他在現場發現了
那把手槍</text></caption>
              <caption name="10 — 進而揭開二十三年前槍擊案的真相" lane="1" offset="22.86s" start="0s" duration="3.62s" role="captions.zh-Hant?captionFormat=ITT.zh-Hant"><text placement="bottom" alignment="center">進而揭開二十三年前
